Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: DND

asr-000217
00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:35.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: family.

asr-000219
00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Now,

asr-000220
00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: let's go

asr-000221
00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: to the business.

asr-000222
