Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: West Philippine Sea

asr-000223
00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: surveillance

asr-000224
00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:41.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and timely

asr-000225
00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:42.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: verification.

asr-000226
00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: In June 2026,

asr-000227
00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:44.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the Government

asr-000228
00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:45.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: investigated

asr-000229
00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:46.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: reports

asr-000230
00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:47.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: of a possible

asr-000231
00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:48.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: new structure

asr-000232
00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: at Bajo de Masinlo.

asr-000233
00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Secretary Teodoro

asr-000234
00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:52.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: stated at the time

asr-000235
00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:53.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: that the information

asr-000236
00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: remains

asr-000237
00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:56.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: remain unverified.

asr-000238
00:13:57.800 --> 00:13:58.750
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What has the

asr-000239
00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.260
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: department established regarding those

asr-000240
00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:02.260
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: reports and what lessons

asr-000241
00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:04.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: have been incorporated into

asr-000242
00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:06.340
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the 2027 surveillance

asr-000243
00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:08.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and verification requirements?

asr-000244
00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker,

asr-000245
00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: there was no permanent

asr-000246
00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:24.680
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: structure.

asr-000247
00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:27.500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Come again?

asr-000247-split-2
00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:28.180
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: There was no permanent

asr-000248
00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:29.400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: structure.

asr-000248-split-2
00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:30.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-000249
00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:32.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So my follow-up question, without

asr-000250
00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:34.560
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: disclosing sensitive coverage

asr-000251
00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.440
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: or deployment details, what

asr-000252
00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:38.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: limits the department's

asr-000253
00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:40.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ability to verify significant

asr-000254
00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:42.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: maritime developments

asr-000255
00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:42.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: promptly?

asr-000257
00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:10.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, there are several factors to be considered, but mainly it's the accuracy of the information.

asr-000258
00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:12.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What's that again?

asr-000259
00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:15.740
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The accuracy of the information, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000260
00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:18.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-000261
00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:26.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: My next question, does the proposed budget address those constraints through better information sharing,

asr-000262
00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:32.860
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: additional operating resources, or new surveillance capabilities?

asr-000263
00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:33.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Capabilities.

asr-000264
00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:54.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000265
00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.520
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The idea is that...

asr-000266
00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:58.300
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's a stepping stone.

asr-000267
00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:06.900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: We want a gradual increase in operations as well.

asr-000268
00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:10.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: As far as your surveillance capabilities, Mr. Speaker?

asr-000269
00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:11.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000270
00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:20.100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How are the information expenditure requirements coordinated with the Philippine Coast Guard and other relevant agencies?

asr-000271
00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:26.100
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: There is real-time coordination information.

asr-000272
00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:39.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, you mean the coordination between the Philippine Coast Guard and other relevant agencies required expenditure and sharing of information.

asr-000273
00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:41.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, paano nyo ginagawa yun?

asr-000274
00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:47.540
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The department has fusion centers.

asr-000275
00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:49.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What's that?

asr-000276
00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.300
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Fusion centers, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000277
00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:51.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-000278
00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:53.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Then, my follow-up question.

asr-000279
00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:56.380
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What improvements should Filipino fishermen...

asr-000280
00:16:56.540 --> 00:17:01.680
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: and civilian maritime personnel expect in case of emergency?

asr-000281
00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:07.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Communication assistance and coordination during incidents at sea?

asr-000282
00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:13.640
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, ano pong inaasaan ng ating mga fishermen in case na, as we know,

asr-000283
00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:17.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: lagi natin napapanood, laging may aksidente niyan?

asr-000284
00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:17.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-000285
00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:37.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The Coast Guard is increasing its fleet. It is also coordinating with the Philippines with regard to increasing the fleet capacity.

asr-000286
00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:46.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, does the fisherman, inaalalayan ba sila ng ating mga Coast Guard pag sila'y nasa laot?

asr-000364
00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:54.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Are they being given instruction or advice where to go, where to do their fishing?

asr-000365
00:17:55.680 --> 00:18:04.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Pag nangingisda sila, mayroon ba tayong sinusunod na or area kung saan sila pwede maghanap buhay?

asr-000366
00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:05.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000367
00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:11.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The Coast Guard and the BFAR, there is also assistance for fuel.

asr-000368
00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:16.340
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Then, my next question, balikatan exercises.

asr-000369
00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:20.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Defense benefits, costs, and management of regional tension.

asr-000370
00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:26.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The Philippines has broadened its joint military activities with defense partners,

asr-000371
00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:30.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: including the United States, Japan, France.

asr-000372
00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:39.100
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Balikatan 2026 included activities in Itbayat, Batanes, near Taiwan, and drew criticism from China.

asr-000373
00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:48.030
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Question: What specific defense objectives do these exercises seek to achieve?

asr-000382
00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:17.620
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000383
00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:20.360
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The objective really is terrain awareness.

asr-000384
00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:25.980
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The idea of the department is a whole 360 terrain awareness.

asr-000385
00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:34.900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, all of the exercises, air exercises, land exercises, are in pursuit of that objective of terrain awareness.

asr-000386
00:19:35.140 --> 00:19:41.540
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, it's basically acclimatizing our troops towards the terrain.

asr-000387
00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:46.060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Another objective also is to introduce our troops to new types of defense.

asr-000388
00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:47.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Types of weaponry and machinery.

asr-000389
00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:55.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, in short, we do this exercise through awareness.

asr-000390
00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:57.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Ito yung gusto natin malaman.

asr-000391
00:19:57.480 --> 00:20:03.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: At the same time, siguro para matrain din ang ating mga sandatang lakas.

asr-000392
00:20:03.980 --> 00:20:12.400
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: My question, do China think this balikatan exercise as an aggressive toward them?

asr-000393
00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000417
00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:52.380
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Given the scale of the operations, there won't be any reason for it to be treated as aggression.

asr-000418
00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:55.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: At least that is the stance of the department.

asr-000419
00:20:56.660 --> 00:21:06.180
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Then again, all of these joint activities are somewhat construed as provocative given its objective.

asr-000420
00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:09.800
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-000421
00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:18.000
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What measurable improvements in the armed forces' capabilities have resulted from previous exercises?

asr-000422
00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:24.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Did we gain anything from the Balikatan exercises as far as our armed forces is concerned?

asr-000423
00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:47.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000424
00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:59.800
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Actually, one of the successes of the Balikatan exercises is that the experience of those exercises enabled the Philippines to lead a 40-fighter strike in Australia.

asr-000425
00:22:00.740 --> 00:22:06.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, it just shows the increase in the capabilities of our troops because of these Balikatan exercises.

asr-000426
00:22:06.660 --> 00:22:06.840
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-000427
00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:09.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Last question for this particular department.

asr-000428
00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:12.420
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Balikatan exercises, and I move to the other topic.

asr-000429
00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:25.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What measures are in place to prevent miscalculation and manage regional tensions while preserving the Philippines' independent defense decision?

asr-000430
00:22:32.560 --> 00:22:37.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, it's strict adherence to UNCLOS and international law.

asr-000431
00:22:37.360 --> 00:22:37.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: UNCLOS.

asr-000432
00:22:39.800 --> 00:22:42.480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And I'll move to my next topic, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000433
00:22:43.100 --> 00:22:48.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: This regards the drone expansion, artificial intelligence, and secure systems.

asr-000434
00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:59.620
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: August 25, 2026, Budget Hearing Secretary Teodoro discussed expanding the military's unmanned capabilities.

asr-000435
00:22:59.620 --> 00:23:09.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: He emphasized that effective use requires operational integration, secure communication, and supporting networks,

asr-000436
00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:12.720
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: not simply the acquisition of more drones.

asr-000437
00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:13.660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Question.

asr-000438
00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:26.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How does proposed 2027 budget ensure that drone acquisitions are accompanied by the systems and trained personnel needed to use them effectively?

asr-000441
00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:48.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000442
00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:54.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, these integration systems are being introduced in this particular budget.

asr-000443
00:23:55.380 --> 00:24:04.800
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: This would be under C4ISTAR, so Command, Control, Communication, Computers, Intelligence, Surveillance, Target Acquisition, and Reconnaissance,

asr-000444
00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:08.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: which is one of the core pillars of the comprehensive archipelagic defense concept.

asr-000445
00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:17.140
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Do you know how, Mr. Speaker, do you know how, and District Sponsor, do you know how much the budget for these drones?

asr-000446
00:24:34.540 --> 00:24:39.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For the fiscal year 2027 proposed budget,

asr-000447
00:24:39.080 --> 00:24:42.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, it's the funding of the governance systems first before,

asr-000448
00:24:43.440 --> 00:24:46.880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the governance systems for the drones before we actually use the drones.

asr-000449
00:24:47.360 --> 00:24:50.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, we need to fund the governance systems first.

asr-000450
00:24:52.140 --> 00:25:00.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Does the department use artificial intelligence models to process imagery,

asr-000451
00:25:00.580 --> 00:25:07.920
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: identify unusual activity, or prioritize information for human analysts?

asr-000452
00:25:24.780 --> 00:25:27.320
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The department cannot disclose.

asr-000453
00:25:29.020 --> 00:25:30.120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Come again?

asr-000454
00:25:30.440 --> 00:25:31.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The department cannot disclose.

asr-000455
00:25:32.240 --> 00:25:32.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Cannot?

asr-000456
00:25:33.100 --> 00:25:33.700
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Disclose.

asr-000457
00:25:33.700 --> 00:25:34.300
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay.

asr-000458
00:25:35.900 --> 00:25:36.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Fair enough.

asr-000459
00:25:38.220 --> 00:25:38.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Next question.

asr-000460
00:25:39.080 --> 00:25:50.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Would additional funding produce greater benefits if directed toward analytical personnel, communications, and maintenance rather than additional equipment alone?

asr-000461
00:25:52.360 --> 00:25:53.060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000462
00:25:53.620 --> 00:25:54.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay. Thank you.

asr-000463
00:25:54.800 --> 00:25:56.320
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Now, I move to another topic.

asr-000464
00:25:56.760 --> 00:26:01.160
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Expanded defense partnerships and their budgetary requirements.

asr-000465
00:26:01.980 --> 00:26:07.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The Philippines and France signed a visiting forces agreement in March 2026.

asr-000466
00:26:07.020 --> 00:26:09.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The proposed performance documents,

asr-000467
00:26:09.080 --> 00:26:19.180
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: the target for bilateral and multilateral engagement also rises from 159 in 2026 to 242 in 2027.

asr-000468
00:26:19.180 --> 00:26:20.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Question.

asr-000469
00:26:20.820 --> 00:26:29.360
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: What capability gains justify the proposed increase in bilateral and multilateral engagement?

asr-000485
00:27:47.080 --> 00:28:14.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker. There are classified capability changes that the department is already observing with regard to our capabilities and defense posture. That would justify the increase of the targets of our bilateral and multilateral partnerships with other government partners.

asr-000486
00:28:14.040 --> 00:28:28.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you. Next, I have only three last questions, three questions. What arrangements determine which costs are borne by the Philippines and which are borne by partner countries?

asr-000489
00:29:08.940 --> 00:29:17.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The general rule is, if it's an expense incurred of our troops, of our machinery, then that's our counterpart cost.

asr-000490
00:29:18.160 --> 00:29:25.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Whereas, those that involve the troops and the machinery of counterparts, then the counterparts bear that cost.

asr-000491
00:29:27.580 --> 00:29:30.080
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So, in short, what's the proposition? Kanya-kanya sila?

asr-000492
00:29:30.260 --> 00:29:30.540
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-000493
00:29:30.980 --> 00:29:35.040
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Most likely, it's a 50-50 proposition. Fair enough. Thank you.

asr-000494
00:29:35.480 --> 00:29:37.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Next, how does the department assess?

asr-000495
00:29:37.980 --> 00:29:44.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Whether participation improves operational proficiency or interoperability?

asr-000496
00:29:50.020 --> 00:29:58.620
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, every exercise, Mr. Speaker, is scored. There is an assessment with regards to indicators.

asr-000497
00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:17.940
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: For my last question, which recently completed defense initiative has produced the clearest measurable improvement relative to its cost and what made it successful?

asr-000498
00:30:45.300 --> 00:30:54.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, the department says it's Exercise Pitch Black, which was conducted in Australia.

asr-000498-split-2
00:30:54.780 --> 00:30:55.600
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Exercise what?

asr-000498-split-3
00:30:55.600 --> 00:30:59.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Pitch Black. Pitch Black.

asr-000499
00:31:01.260 --> 00:31:01.840
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: In Australia.

asr-000500
00:31:02.580 --> 00:31:16.760
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Okay. Again, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, I support the budget of Department of National Defense and to the ND family, thank you for your service. Thank you very much, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000501
00:31:17.740 --> 00:31:18.260
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Leader.

asr-000502
00:31:19.560 --> 00:31:28.340
Rep. Arnan C. Panaligan: Mr. Speaker, I move to recognize the Honorable Sarah Jane Elago of Partylist Gabriela Women's Party for her interpellation.

asr-000503
00:31:28.340 --> 00:31:29.900
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Honorable Sarah Jane.

asr-000504
00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:32.320
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Elago is recognized. Please proceed.

asr-000505
00:31:34.940 --> 00:31:37.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000506
00:31:38.540 --> 00:31:46.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Una tungkol sa tatag ng infrastruktura para sa kapayapaan at siguridad projects o mga tikas projects.

asr-000507
00:31:47.420 --> 00:31:59.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mula taong 2019 hanggang 2025, may total budget ang tikas program, ang convergence program ng DND at DPWH na P38.03 billion.

asr-000508
00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:09.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mula 2019 hanggang end of 2025, ilan na nga ba talaga ang total approved tikas projects?

asr-000509
00:32:09.740 --> 00:32:17.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ilan dito ang complete, ongoing, delayed, unusable, suspended, at magsisimula pa lang?

asr-000510
00:32:17.960 --> 00:32:29.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang mga katanungan po na ito ay naitanong na rin natin noong budget briefing, ngunit hindi po tayo nakakuha noong detalyado na status report na kada proyekto.

asr-000511
00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:40.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At medyo nalito pa po tayo dahil magkakaiba po yung bilang ng proyekto na naibigay po sa representasyon na ito.

asr-000512
00:32:41.540 --> 00:33:02.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Una, noong October 8, 2025, sang-ayon po kay DND Secretary Chodoro sa isang news report, sinabi na may 944 approved projects mula 2019 at 648 projects dito ang kumpleto na.

asr-000513
00:33:02.640 --> 00:33:28.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit sa pareho, ayon naman kay AFP Chief of Staff Brawner, from 2019 to 2025, ang TIKAS po ay may 927 approved infrastructure projects, samantalang 663 ang completed at meron pang 139 na ongoing.

asr-000514
00:33:28.840 --> 00:33:57.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakuha natin na submission mula sa Department of National Defense. Mula 2021 hanggang 2026, ang Philippine Army may 472 TICAS projects worth 14.496 billion. At para naman sa Philippine Air Force, mula taong 2019 hanggang 2025, meron pong 159 projects worth 4.806 billion.

asr-000515
00:33:57.700 --> 00:34:16.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung bilang po na nakuha natin mula sa 2021 hanggang 2026 sa Philippine Army at mula sa 2019 hanggang 2025 ay hindi po nagtutugma dun sa 900 plus approved projects na unang nabalita mula noong nakaraang taon.

asr-000516
00:34:17.380 --> 00:34:26.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po ba itong maipaliwanag ng ating distinguished sponsor? At kung maaari po makapagbigay kayo ng ano po ba talaga yung datos?

asr-000517
00:34:26.340 --> 00:34:29.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagdating sa mga proyektong ito.

asr-000518
00:34:29.960 --> 00:35:23.880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. For the TIKAS program, if I may enumerate: for the Philippine Army from 2021 to 2026, the number of projects is 413. That is the total number of projects, 413. For the Philippine Air Force from 2019 to 2025, it is 159 projects. For the Philippine Navy from 2019 to 2025, it is 117 projects. And then the GHQ proper from 2020 to 2026 is 233 projects. So that totals to 922 total projects.

asr-000519
00:35:23.880 --> 00:35:26.060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: With regards to completion,

asr-000520
00:35:26.340 --> 00:35:35.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For those that have been completed, for the Philippine Army, it's 273 completed projects.

asr-000521
00:35:36.200 --> 00:35:42.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For the Philippine Air Force, it's 133 completed projects.

asr-000522
00:35:43.040 --> 00:35:47.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The Philippine Navy, 91 completed projects.

asr-000523
00:35:48.260 --> 00:35:51.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: GHQ proper, 12 completed.

asr-000524
00:35:51.040 --> 00:35:56.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So that's a total of 509 projects.

asr-000525
00:35:56.340 --> 00:36:08.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, saan po nanggagaling yung nasa 400 plus na unaccounted dun po sa naiulat ninyo?

asr-000526
00:36:08.120 --> 00:36:16.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi ang sabi po noong October 2025, 944 po yung total na bilang ng approved projects.

asr-000527
00:36:16.800 --> 00:36:20.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At mangingila lang po ako ng detalya nito.

asr-000528
00:36:21.320 --> 00:36:26.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pwede po ba natin kunin ang commitment ng ating distinguished sponsor, ang DND, pagdating po?

asr-000529
00:36:26.340 --> 00:36:28.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa report mismo.

asr-000530
00:36:28.580 --> 00:36:33.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi gusto po natin makita saan ba yung lakasyon, saan ba napunta yung pondo,

asr-000531
00:36:33.940 --> 00:36:36.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: natapos na ba talaga ang mga infrastruktura,

asr-000532
00:36:37.900 --> 00:36:47.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: upang matiyak natin na ang pondo po ng ating bayan ay napupunta talaga sa kung saan ito layon na magasta.

asr-000533
00:36:48.780 --> 00:36:52.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon po, yung nabanggit nyo ng mga completed na mga projects,

asr-000534
00:36:53.140 --> 00:36:55.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lahat ba ito may turnover documents na?

asr-000535
00:36:56.340 --> 00:37:00.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At lahat ba ito ay natayo sa mga lupa na meron ng titulo?

asr-000536
00:37:00.420 --> 00:37:01.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Thank you.

asr-000537
00:37:49.350 --> 00:37:56.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, tumatakbo ang aking oras. May I pause habang naghihintay sa ating distinguished sponsor?

asr-000538
00:37:56.320 --> 00:37:57.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At yung ating distinguished sponsor.

asr-000539
00:38:03.840 --> 00:38:11.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, well, first, just to address the number.

asr-000540
00:38:13.280 --> 00:38:16.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Ito po kasing number 922, ito po yung completed.

asr-000541
00:38:18.360 --> 00:38:25.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But meron kasi tayo ng mga projects na designed.

asr-000542
00:38:26.320 --> 00:38:28.200
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Depende kasi yun dun sa design.

asr-000543
00:38:28.380 --> 00:38:30.220
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So minsan nagkakaproblema po tayo dun.

asr-000544
00:38:30.860 --> 00:38:34.640
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Kaya po, hindi po siya nako-complete.

asr-000545
00:38:34.940 --> 00:38:40.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Kasi besides na iba yung disenyo, minsan po yung lupa may dispute.

asr-000546
00:38:40.700 --> 00:38:42.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Minsan din po may facing.

asr-000547
00:38:42.560 --> 00:38:47.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So yung binention ko po na 509 na completed projects,

asr-000548
00:38:48.420 --> 00:38:55.520
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: completed po siya kasi yun po talaga yung na-turnover na proper documentation and all that.

asr-000549
00:38:55.520 --> 00:38:55.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But,

asr-000550
00:38:56.320 --> 00:39:00.980
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: yung rest po, yung differential na yung 122 at saka ng 509,

asr-000551
00:39:01.620 --> 00:39:03.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: may facing po kasi talaga siya.

asr-000552
00:39:04.860 --> 00:39:07.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Gusto rin pong sabihin ng departamento na

asr-000553
00:39:07.720 --> 00:39:12.240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: ang implementing agency po ng TCAS ay ang DPWH.

asr-000554
00:39:13.260 --> 00:39:18.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, kung may mga ganito pong mga katanungan in terms of

asr-000555
00:39:18.440 --> 00:39:21.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: ano yung rason for the delays,

asr-000556
00:39:22.740 --> 00:39:26.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: DPWH po ang mapapagtanungan natin ng mga konserwasyon.

asr-000557
00:39:26.320 --> 00:39:26.680
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Or na yun.

asr-000558
00:39:28.080 --> 00:39:35.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mister Speaker, hindi po ba kasaba ang DND sa nag-issue ng Joint Memorandum Circular No. 44,

asr-000559
00:39:36.060 --> 00:39:37.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: series of 2024?

asr-000560
00:39:38.080 --> 00:39:41.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po ba itong balikan ng ating Distinguished Sponsor at ng ating departamento?

asr-000561
00:39:43.600 --> 00:39:50.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Anong sinasabi dyan na obligation po ng DND pagdating sa monitoring at evaluation

asr-000562
00:39:50.400 --> 00:39:54.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng mga proyekto sa ilalim ng TCAS program?

asr-000564
00:40:26.320 --> 00:40:49.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker. As of now, with regards to those that have been the ongoing projects from the time before 2025, continuing pa po yung validation of these projects.

asr-000565
00:40:51.380 --> 00:40:56.300
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Nag-conduct po ng validation and assessment din ang Department of National Defense.

asr-000566
00:40:56.320 --> 00:40:58.540
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: In terms of kamusta yung mga structure.

asr-000567
00:40:59.700 --> 00:41:04.400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But yung implementing agency po talaga kasi ay DPWH.

asr-000568
00:41:05.040 --> 00:41:20.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, pero on the part of the DND, we are assured na kung meron mang delays po doon sa implementation ng itong mga TICAS projects, ay nag-a-assess din po on-site ang DND.

asr-000569
00:41:21.320 --> 00:41:25.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron na po bang risulta ang inyong mga initial assessment?

asr-000570
00:41:26.320 --> 00:41:26.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May ginawa?

asr-000571
00:41:27.180 --> 00:41:44.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa, Mr. Speaker, nabanggit din po noong budget briefing na meron po for 2026, 27 non-implementable at may 51 na implementable pa na proyekto sa ilalim ng TICAS program.

asr-000572
00:41:46.900 --> 00:41:52.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano po ba ang ibig sabihin ng binanggit na non-implementable?

asr-000573
00:41:53.840 --> 00:41:55.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin po ba may mga limitations?

asr-000574
00:41:56.320 --> 00:42:04.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa paggamit ng budget? May mga, meron ba ang factor ng impossibility

asr-000575
00:42:04.760 --> 00:42:08.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil sa mga problema halimbawa sa lupa na katulad ng nabanggit

asr-000576
00:42:08.840 --> 00:42:13.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng ating distinguished sponsor? May update po ba kayo kung nagbago na

asr-000577
00:42:13.460 --> 00:42:17.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang mga bilang na ito ng mga implementable at non-implementable?

asr-000578
00:42:17.000 --> 00:42:26.280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker. Based on official data, ang terminated or suspended

asr-000579
00:42:26.280 --> 00:42:35.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: po na projects, one of the factors being may problema sa lupa, is 43.

asr-000580
00:42:36.040 --> 00:42:44.220
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: 43 projects. With regards to updates as to even those ongoing projects

asr-000581
00:42:44.220 --> 00:42:46.980
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: na might be terminated because of disputes in land

asr-000582
00:42:46.980 --> 00:42:49.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and other problems with implementation.

asr-000583
00:42:49.960 --> 00:42:56.880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: implementation. Again, the DND cannot give information on it given that

asr-000584
00:42:56.880 --> 00:42:59.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the implementing agency would be the DPWH.

asr-000585
00:43:00.600 --> 00:43:04.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, mahirap po na ganyan po ang kasagutan sa atin.

asr-000586
00:43:04.600 --> 00:43:10.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil malinaw po sa DND-DPWH Joint Memorandum Circular No. 44,

asr-000587
00:43:10.920 --> 00:43:16.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Series of 2024, na may tatlo pong mahalaga na obligation dito ang DND.

asr-000588
00:43:16.980 --> 00:43:23.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Unang-una, lahat ng potential military infrastructure projects ay magmumula

asr-000589
00:43:23.240 --> 00:43:30.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa DND AFP units. Pangalawa, DND Secretary ang mag-e-endorse ng validated,

asr-000590
00:43:31.400 --> 00:43:36.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: evaluated, at prioritized list ng TICAS projects sa DPWH Secretary.

asr-000591
00:43:37.540 --> 00:43:44.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At pangatlo, at pinakamahalaga, Mr. Speaker, may obligasyon ang DND representative

asr-000592
00:43:44.420 --> 00:43:47.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa Joint Project Monitoring and

asr-000593
00:43:47.680 --> 00:44:08.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Supervising Team na mag-observe ng conduct ng procurement activities, mag-monitor ng project progress, mag-resolve ng issues habang ini-implement ang projects at magsumite ng monthly accomplishment reports.

asr-000594
00:44:08.720 --> 00:44:46.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po yung dahilan kung bakit hinihingi natin sa DND mismo yung lagay, yung status ng mga proyektong ito, dahil hindi naman po biro yung ₱38 billion. Mas mataas pa po yan sa buong budget ng DOST para sa susunod na taon. Kaya napakahalaga ng bawat piso na ginagastos sa mga proyektong ito. Ngayon naman, hihintayin po natin yung detalyadong status report na may kinalaman dito sa TIKAS program.

asr-000595
00:44:46.960 --> 00:44:53.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit hayaan niyo po akong dumiretso sa naging sagot sa atin para sa TIKAS sa susunod na taon, for fiscal year 2027.

asr-000596
00:44:53.880 --> 00:45:04.830
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang sinasabi po ay walang TIKAS project para sa 2027. Tama po ba?

asr-000597
00:45:07.870 --> 00:45:12.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Wala na po. Wala na pong TIKAS projects for 2027 as per the DND. Opo.

asr-000598
00:45:12.080 --> 00:45:18.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit napansin din po ng representasyon na ito na may mga proyekto po sa ilalim ng DPWH,

asr-000599
00:45:19.800 --> 00:45:29.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa ilalim po ng Basic Infrastructure Program o BIP na nakalista sa ilalim ng TICAS program noong taong 2024 at 2025.

asr-000600
00:45:30.100 --> 00:45:34.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin po, project na po siya sa 2024 at 2025.

asr-000601
00:45:34.280 --> 00:45:40.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero nagulat po kami na nalista po ulit sa BIP para sa taong 2027.

asr-000602
00:45:42.040 --> 00:45:50.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Noong tinignan po namin yung mga projects na ito sa DPWH website, napansin po namin na meron po dito expired na ang contracts.

asr-000603
00:45:51.760 --> 00:45:55.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero hindi pa nagsisimula o ongoing pa lang ang proyekto.

asr-000604
00:45:56.040 --> 00:45:59.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May mga proyekto din po na lagpas na sa project costs.

asr-000605
00:45:59.300 --> 00:46:00.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang nailaan na budget.

asr-000606
00:46:01.820 --> 00:46:05.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa na lang, Mr. Speaker, sa Region 3 po.

asr-000607
00:46:06.480 --> 00:46:14.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Construction ng multi-purpose building, two-story unit barracks at boot camp, two area sa San Antonio, Zambales.

asr-000608
00:46:15.000 --> 00:46:18.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang contract cost po ay 56.91 million.

asr-000609
00:46:18.780 --> 00:46:25.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Habang 60 million pesos ang nakalaan sa ilalim ng 2024 GAA.

asr-000610
00:46:26.280 --> 00:46:28.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O baga may sobra pa pong konting million.

asr-000611
00:46:28.120 --> 00:46:29.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At may daan.

asr-000612
00:46:29.300 --> 00:46:34.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May dagdag na 6.5 million pesos sa ilalim ng 2027 NEP.

asr-000613
00:46:35.820 --> 00:46:44.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin po, nalista na sa 2024 tapos may dagdag po na 6.5 million pesos sa 2027 NEP.

asr-000614
00:46:45.520 --> 00:46:52.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nagsimula po ang proyekto noong September 2024 at ang kontrata expired na ng July 2025.

asr-000615
00:46:53.280 --> 00:46:59.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Gayunman, ang sabi po dito sa DPWH website tungkol sa project,

asr-000616
00:46:59.140 --> 00:47:04.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ito, 66.81% pa lang po ang physical accomplishment.

asr-000617
00:47:05.460 --> 00:47:12.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Gayun din, tungkol naman po sa rehabilitation ng multi-purpose building,

asr-000618
00:47:12.460 --> 00:47:18.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: two units, six-door, married personal quarters, flat house, sa parehong lugar po.

asr-000619
00:47:18.680 --> 00:47:27.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang contract cost ay 28.67 million pesos, habang 30 million pesos ang nasa 2025 na manag-AA.

asr-000620
00:47:27.040 --> 00:47:28.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At may dagdag po itong

asr-000621
00:47:28.440 --> 00:47:34.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 25 million sa 2027 NEP.

asr-000622
00:47:34.240 --> 00:47:41.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hanggang ngayon po, 0% po ang nakareflex sa DPWH website na accomplishment ng proyekto na ito.

asr-000623
00:47:41.920 --> 00:47:46.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bakit po ba hindi natatapos ang mga proyekto sa loob ng naitakda na contract period?

asr-000624
00:47:47.600 --> 00:47:50.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At bakit po ba kailangan magkaroon ng dagdag na budget?

asr-000625
00:47:51.160 --> 00:47:52.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sino po ba yung nag-assess?

asr-000626
00:47:52.620 --> 00:47:57.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sino po yung nag-submit sa DPWH ng mga proyekto na ito?

asr-000627
00:47:57.120 --> 00:47:59.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na napondohan na dati sa ilalim ng 2027 NEP.

asr-000628
00:47:59.140 --> 00:48:06.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na napondohan na dati sa ilalim ng TICAS, hindi natapos, may dagdag na naman po tayo para sa 2027,

asr-000629
00:48:07.220 --> 00:48:10.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na malinaw po sa item na TICAS pa rin.

asr-000630
00:48:10.680 --> 00:48:18.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So hindi po totoo na wala pong TICAS program, maaari po hindi na TICAS po yung tawag,

asr-000631
00:48:18.340 --> 00:48:24.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil ang sabi nga sa atin ng DPWH, nagkaroon na po sila ng consolidation ng mga infrastructure program.

asr-000632
00:48:25.180 --> 00:48:28.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So hindi man ito TICAS, pero nakita po natin na pareho,

asr-000633
00:48:29.140 --> 00:48:33.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung line item na nakasulat po sa mga taon na ito.

asr-000634
00:48:37.860 --> 00:48:46.380
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, the Department takes note of these concerns and will review.

asr-000635
00:48:48.100 --> 00:48:55.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: If the distinguished colleague can also furnish us a copy of these details so we can review.

asr-000636
00:48:55.000 --> 00:49:02.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But for fiscal year 2027, the Department confirms that no TICAS projects have been submitted.

asr-000637
00:49:03.160 --> 00:49:05.940
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: There's no list of any projects under the TICAS program.

asr-000638
00:49:07.600 --> 00:49:08.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ay, sige po.

asr-000639
00:49:09.600 --> 00:49:16.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, Mr. Speaker, ang nakakabahala po dito, kasi po ang sagot po sa atin ng DND noong budget briefing,

asr-000640
00:49:16.260 --> 00:49:17.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay magtanong po tayo sa DPWH.

asr-000641
00:49:18.380 --> 00:49:20.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nung nagtanong po tayo sa DPWH,

asr-000642
00:49:22.080 --> 00:49:22.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ah,

asr-000643
00:49:23.680 --> 00:49:24.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: gusto ko pa,

asr-000644
00:49:24.340 --> 00:49:24.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sanang sabihin,

asr-000645
00:49:25.000 --> 00:49:26.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na nagulat po ako,

asr-000646
00:49:26.340 --> 00:49:31.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pero medyo hindi po ako nagulat doon sa sagot sa akin na wala rin pong update

asr-000647
00:49:31.760 --> 00:49:36.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol dito sa monitoring, evaluation,

asr-000648
00:49:36.680 --> 00:49:43.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at pagchecheck ng bilyon-bilyon na pondo para po sa TICAS program.

asr-000649
00:49:44.240 --> 00:49:46.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ang banggit po noon ni Secretary Dizon,

asr-000650
00:49:47.080 --> 00:49:51.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay nung panahon na yun na chinecheck po natin itong TICAS program,

asr-000651
00:49:51.240 --> 00:49:53.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay kakalagay niya lang din po sa DPWH.

asr-000652
00:49:53.980 --> 00:49:54.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nagbigay naman po,

asr-000653
00:49:55.000 --> 00:49:59.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng commitment na iimbestigahan at titignan ang proyekto na ito.

asr-000654
00:49:59.880 --> 00:50:05.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At yan din po ang aasahan natin na maitanong pagbalik ng DPWH dito sa plenaryo.

asr-000655
00:50:06.120 --> 00:50:12.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero dahil inunote na rin po ng ating distinguished sponsor at ng DND ang ating concern tungkol dito,

asr-000656
00:50:13.360 --> 00:50:18.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: napansin po namin na ang T2B3 Builders and Supplies Corporation

asr-000657
00:50:18.880 --> 00:50:23.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay kabilang po sa contractors na nakuha sa mga TICAS projects.

asr-000658
00:50:23.760 --> 00:50:28.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakakuha rin po ito ng maraming government, infrastructure contracts,

asr-000659
00:50:28.800 --> 00:50:33.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kabilang na po ang mga flood control projects.

asr-000660
00:50:33.920 --> 00:50:37.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa TICAS project, halimbawa po,

asr-000661
00:50:38.380 --> 00:50:43.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa isa pong proyekto na T2B3 Builders and Supplies Corporation ang contractor,

asr-000662
00:50:44.520 --> 00:50:49.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: meron po silang isang proyekto na 66.81% lang po ang accomplishment

asr-000663
00:50:49.740 --> 00:50:53.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kahit nag-expire na ang kontrata noong July 17, 2020.

asr-000664
00:50:53.760 --> 00:50:57.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At hanggang ngayon, nakalista pa rin ang ongoing project.

asr-000665
00:50:58.300 --> 00:51:02.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi po ba ito malinaw na red flag sa tingin po ng ating distinguished sponsor?

asr-000666
00:51:03.180 --> 00:51:11.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At dahil po sa ganitong issue, dapat, hindi na po talaga tayo maghintay pa ng isang taon,

asr-000667
00:51:12.100 --> 00:51:18.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: agad-agad, kinakailangan po talagang imbestigahan ang ganitong tipo po ng mga gawain.

asr-000668
00:51:18.400 --> 00:51:22.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At yung isa pong contractor na na-flag na for flood control projects,

asr-000669
00:51:23.760 --> 00:51:30.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: isa rin po sa mga hindi nakakatapos ng proyekto sa ilalim ng TICAS program.

asr-000670
00:51:32.100 --> 00:51:38.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron po ba tayong marinig na posisyon dito ng ating distinguished sponsor?

asr-000671
00:51:39.980 --> 00:51:47.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Isa rin po kasi sa hiningi nating detalya ng budget briefing kung sino po yung mga contractor dun sa mga TICAS program.

asr-000672
00:51:47.200 --> 00:51:53.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi hindi po natin gusto maulit yung nangyari sa flood control.

asr-000673
00:51:53.760 --> 00:51:59.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na marami pong mga proyekto, ang kala po natin at inaasahan natin makatulong sa ating bayan,

asr-000674
00:52:00.180 --> 00:52:02.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pero hindi naman po natatapos.

asr-000675
00:52:20.980 --> 00:52:23.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The department, Mr. Speaker,

asr-000676
00:52:23.760 --> 00:52:25.240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: will raise it with the DPWH.

asr-000677
00:52:25.580 --> 00:52:31.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It takes note of the concern given that it's the DPWH that was involved with the awarding process.

asr-000678
00:52:33.020 --> 00:52:34.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, mainam.

asr-000679
00:52:34.900 --> 00:52:40.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, talagang sa lalong madaling panahon, magkaroon po dito ng imbestigasyon,

asr-000680
00:52:40.580 --> 00:52:45.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: makasuhan ang dapat makasuhan, may habulin tayo kung may dapat mapanagot,

asr-000681
00:52:45.320 --> 00:52:51.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at matiyak po natin na yung bilyong-bilyong pondo ay nailalagay para dun sa kadyang layunin.

asr-000682
00:52:51.880 --> 00:52:52.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At,

asr-000683
00:52:53.760 --> 00:52:58.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung binanggit ko po kanina na nasa ilalim ng BIP, hindi pa po yun lahat.

asr-000684
00:52:58.600 --> 00:53:02.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi, nasa libo po yung nasa ilalim ng Basic Infrastructure Program.

asr-000685
00:53:02.520 --> 00:53:05.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dati po kasi, Mr. Speaker, di ba, nakahati yan per department.

asr-000686
00:53:06.140 --> 00:53:09.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung sino yung mga kapartner po nila ng mga agencies.

asr-000687
00:53:09.440 --> 00:53:13.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa, ang Department of Tourism, dati merong Tourism Road Infrastructure Project.

asr-000688
00:53:14.460 --> 00:53:17.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ganon din po sa DND, merong ngayong TICAS.

asr-000689
00:53:17.300 --> 00:53:18.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon po kasi, halo-halo na.

asr-000690
00:53:19.420 --> 00:53:23.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya, yung diligence, pagdating po sa pag-check ng kada isa,

asr-000691
00:53:23.760 --> 00:53:28.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay naway, bigyan din po ng karampatang aksyon ng kapulungan na ito.

asr-000692
00:53:29.260 --> 00:53:35.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, ginoong speaker, nais ko pong magtanong tungkol sa ginagastos po ng ating pamahalaan

asr-000693
00:53:35.140 --> 00:53:40.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa Enhanced Defense Cooperation Agreement.

asr-000694
00:53:42.200 --> 00:53:48.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Magkano na po ang nagastos ng EDCA, para sa EDCA, mula po nang ito ay mapirmahan?

asr-000695
00:53:53.760 --> 00:54:14.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Ang nakalagay lang po din sa budget for fiscal year 2027 would be yung regular camp expenses.

asr-000696
00:54:14.340 --> 00:54:22.180
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But, particularly for EDCA, wala po under the fiscal year 2027 proposed budget.

asr-000697
00:54:23.760 --> 00:54:25.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, ginoong speaker.

asr-000698
00:54:25.780 --> 00:54:31.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At muli po, higin po natin yung breakdown ng mga expenses po na iyan.

asr-000699
00:54:31.940 --> 00:54:39.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil, nababahala rin po tayo at matagal na rin po natin itong napaninindigan sa mga kababaihan,

asr-000700
00:54:39.880 --> 00:54:41.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa Gabriela Women's Party.

asr-000701
00:54:41.300 --> 00:54:45.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lalo na po ngayon, sa harap ng tumitinding tensyon sa iba't ibang panig ng mundo,

asr-000702
00:54:45.360 --> 00:54:49.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nadamang-daman ng Pilipinas ngayon, sumirit na naman yung presyo ng langis,

asr-000703
00:54:49.800 --> 00:54:53.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nararapat lang talaga na ang pamahalaan natin,

asr-000704
00:54:53.300 --> 00:55:00.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay tumindig at mag-iit na para sa isang tunay na malaya at nagsasarili na patakarang panlabas.

asr-000705
00:55:00.700 --> 00:55:04.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nagsasarili, independyente na patakarang panlabas.

asr-000706
00:55:04.680 --> 00:55:11.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Independent foreign policy na hindi po natin dapat basta-basta lang ipapagamit ang ating lupain,

asr-000707
00:55:11.580 --> 00:55:19.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga daungan at maging ang mga sibilyang sasakyan dagat upang magsilbi po sa interest ng kahit sino mang mga dayuhan.

asr-000708
00:55:19.120 --> 00:55:21.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ang kaugnay po nito,

asr-000709
00:55:23.300 --> 00:55:29.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa mga fisherfolk na affected ng fishing ban dahil sa balikatang exercises,

asr-000710
00:55:29.580 --> 00:55:37.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nagtanong po ako sa BIFAR kung meron po silang specific line item para po sa pantulong sa ating affected fisherfolk.

asr-000711
00:55:37.780 --> 00:55:39.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang sabi po nila ay wala.

asr-000712
00:55:40.060 --> 00:55:43.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po bang magbigay dito ng paglilinaw ang D&amp;D?

asr-000713
00:55:43.740 --> 00:55:52.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung paano po natin, kumbaga, hindi lang tinutulungan eh, pero dapat nga po natin iwasan yung na maapektuhan,

asr-000714
00:55:53.300 --> 00:55:57.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: po yung kabuhayan ng ating mga manging isda sa ganitong tipo ng mga exercises.

asr-000716
00:56:26.900 --> 00:56:32.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, for the interest of time, mahingina lang po tayo ng plano tungkol dito.

asr-000717
00:56:32.640 --> 00:56:40.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi po, sa tingin ko po, ang hindi biro yung mga 3 to 5 days na hindi po nakakapangisda yung ating mga fisherfolk.

asr-000718
00:56:40.360 --> 00:56:42.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nilirais po nila yung impact talaga.

asr-000719
00:56:43.080 --> 00:56:49.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kabuhayan dun sa kanilang kita, yung lost income nila because of this fishing ban.

asr-000720
00:56:49.460 --> 00:56:53.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang mga manging isda po ang pinakamahirap na sektor.

asr-000721
00:56:53.300 --> 00:56:57.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa ating bansa, may pinakamataas na porsyento ng poverty incidence.

asr-000722
00:56:57.800 --> 00:57:04.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, kada araw na affected yung kanilang kabuhayan ay malaki pong impact sa kanilang mga pamilya.

asr-000723
00:57:05.100 --> 00:57:12.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman ginoong speaker tungkol po sa GAD budget report ng Philippine Commission on Women para sa 2024.

asr-000724
00:57:12.340 --> 00:57:25.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakita po natin doon na mataas po ang percentage ng nagagamit ng DND para po sa gender and development.

asr-000725
00:57:26.540 --> 00:57:32.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mataas po ang kanilang utilization para sa National Action Plan on Women, Peace, and Security.

asr-000726
00:57:32.500 --> 00:57:40.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para sa taong 2024, noong naglabas po ng assessment ang PCW,

asr-000727
00:57:41.140 --> 00:57:41.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nasa 80.6%.

asr-000728
00:57:42.340 --> 00:57:54.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang percentage ng WPS na nagagamit ng diretsyo sa WPS-related activities, programs, and expenditure.

asr-000729
00:57:55.000 --> 00:58:02.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon din po, ang Philippine Army, ang panglima sa may pinakamataas na GAD budget allocation.

asr-000730
00:58:03.140 --> 00:58:05.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nasa 15.37%.

asr-000731
00:58:06.000 --> 00:58:10.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang nakalagay lang po sa ating general provision, at least 5%.

asr-000732
00:58:10.200 --> 00:58:12.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero, nasa times 3 po.

asr-000733
00:58:12.340 --> 00:58:14.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, 15.37%.

asr-000734
00:58:14.500 --> 00:58:17.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po bang mabigay sa atin yung detalye?

asr-000735
00:58:17.980 --> 00:58:24.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano po ba yung mga particular projects at activities ng DND na may kinalaman sa Women, Peace, and Security?

asr-000736
00:58:25.800 --> 00:58:30.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ano po yung mga klase ng activities na nakapaloob sa mga projects na ito?

asr-000737
00:58:35.260 --> 00:58:38.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung maari na rin pong isama ng ating distinguished sponsor,

asr-000738
00:58:39.780 --> 00:58:42.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: isama na rin po sa kanyang UPS,

asr-000739
00:58:42.340 --> 00:58:43.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at kung maulat yung sa Philippine Army?

asr-000740
00:59:01.740 --> 00:59:02.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Oh, yes.

asr-000741
00:59:04.100 --> 00:59:10.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, with regards to the GAD activities

asr-000742
00:59:10.440 --> 00:59:12.320
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: being conducted by the Department of National Defense,

asr-000743
00:59:12.340 --> 00:59:16.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: there are gender-based health interventions.

asr-000744
00:59:17.020 --> 00:59:23.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, kasama po dito yung pagtuturo po sa mga buntis nating mga personel

asr-000745
00:59:23.460 --> 00:59:28.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: kung paano po mag-alaga po ng mga anak nila.

asr-000746
00:59:29.240 --> 00:59:30.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Besides po nun,

asr-000747
00:59:33.700 --> 00:59:38.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: yung international and local engagement on GAD and Women, Peace, and Security,

asr-000748
00:59:38.480 --> 00:59:41.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and then implementation of...

asr-000749
00:59:42.340 --> 00:59:45.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: activities under the PCW-AFP Partnership Agreement.

asr-000750
00:59:46.200 --> 00:59:50.740
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, may assessment and validation of gender mainstreaming performance of the AFP.

asr-000751
00:59:51.440 --> 00:59:56.240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Continuous engagement with DND, OPA, Peru, and PCW on matters pertaining to the GAD.

asr-000752
00:59:57.020 --> 00:59:59.940
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Gender-responsive planning and budgeting seminar workshops.

asr-000753
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:03.900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: with Harmonized GAD Guidelines Applications,

asr-000754
01:00:04.100 --> 01:00:05.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: AFP GAD Family Conference,

asr-000755
01:00:06.760 --> 01:00:09.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: AFP GAD Executive Briefings,

asr-000756
01:00:09.740 --> 01:00:14.380
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: participation and support to the National Women's Month Celebrations,

asr-000757
01:00:15.200 --> 01:00:18.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and 18-day campaign to end violence against women.

asr-000758
01:00:19.600 --> 01:00:23.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Regular conferences of the AFP GAD focal point system,

asr-000759
01:00:24.040 --> 01:00:27.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: formulation, review, and revision of GAD-related policies,

asr-000760
01:00:27.420 --> 01:00:31.320
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: integration of GAD perspective to AFP policies,

asr-000761
01:00:31.900 --> 01:00:36.700
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: ASEAN Institute for Peace and Reconciliation WPS Training Program,

asr-000762
01:00:37.180 --> 01:00:43.180
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and kasama din po doon sa GAD programs and D&amp;D ang Men's Rights Seminars.

asr-000763
01:00:47.840 --> 01:00:53.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano pong nilalaman nung, tama po ba yung rinig ko, Men's Rights Seminars?

asr-000764
01:00:53.680 --> 01:00:55.740
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000765
01:00:55.740 --> 01:00:57.400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Equal rights, of course.

asr-000766
01:00:57.420 --> 01:00:59.060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Men have rights too.

asr-000767
01:01:00.240 --> 01:01:06.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero alam na po natin na kumbaga habang malinaw,

asr-000768
01:01:07.740 --> 01:01:12.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung karapatan ng kababaihan, ng mga kalalakihan, at ng lahat po ng gender diverse people,

asr-000769
01:01:13.520 --> 01:01:16.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang focus naman natin ay hindi kumbaga paghiwalayin,

asr-000770
01:01:16.900 --> 01:01:21.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kundi bigyan nandiin yung pantay na karapatan ng lahat.

asr-000771
01:01:22.400 --> 01:01:22.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Number one.

asr-000772
01:01:22.980 --> 01:01:27.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tapos number two, kaya naman po tayo may special focus,

asr-000773
01:01:27.420 --> 01:01:30.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and attention sa women's rights.

asr-000774
01:01:30.300 --> 01:01:35.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil sa ating kasaysayan, at magpasahangga ngayon,

asr-000775
01:01:36.820 --> 01:01:44.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung prevalence, yung dami, yung lawak, yung tagal ng pagkamit ng justisya,

asr-000776
01:01:44.300 --> 01:01:48.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: halimbawa ng nakakaranas ng iba't ibang forma ng pang-aabuso,

asr-000777
01:01:49.080 --> 01:01:51.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang kalakhan pa rin po talaga ay mga kababaihan.

asr-000778
01:01:52.260 --> 01:01:56.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po, matagal nyo na pong,

asr-000779
01:01:57.420 --> 01:02:00.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ito'y papatupad, ito pong Men's Rights Seminar.

asr-000780
01:02:01.600 --> 01:02:06.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano po yung mga particular courses or subject matter na laman ng mga ito?

asr-000781
01:02:12.340 --> 01:02:13.100
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-000782
01:02:14.180 --> 01:02:19.100
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Isang beses pa lang po daw, ginawa po itong Men's Rights Seminar.

asr-000783
01:02:19.740 --> 01:02:23.740
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Parang intro, production, introductory course pa lang po.

asr-000784
01:02:24.860 --> 01:02:25.620
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Conducted.

asr-000785
01:02:27.420 --> 01:02:33.220
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yeah, it was conducted po by former Justice Sandoval Gutierrez,

asr-000786
01:02:33.460 --> 01:02:35.300
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Angelina Sandoval Gutierrez.

asr-000787
01:02:35.900 --> 01:02:39.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Ano po siya, it revolved around legal discussions on men's rights,

asr-000788
01:02:40.520 --> 01:02:44.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: through jurisprudence on the anti-violence against women and their children act,

asr-000789
01:02:44.820 --> 01:02:46.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and family law remedies.

asr-000790
01:02:46.900 --> 01:02:49.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yun po yung contents of the Men's Rights Seminar.

asr-000791
01:02:50.540 --> 01:02:55.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa kabilang banda, nagbigay din po ba kayo ng pinakalling mga updates sa jurisprudence

asr-000792
01:02:55.380 --> 01:02:57.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na may kinalaman sa mga kaso ng anti-violence?

asr-000793
01:02:57.420 --> 01:02:58.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Anti-violence against women.

asr-000794
01:03:00.300 --> 01:03:00.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-000795
01:03:01.660 --> 01:03:09.160
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: There are counterpart seminars, of course, for [unclear], that is being conducted by the DND

asr-000796
01:03:09.160 --> 01:03:10.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: under the GAD program, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000797
01:03:11.460 --> 01:03:17.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung mainam siguro, Mr. Speaker, na magkaroon din po ng mga pag-aaral seminar,

asr-000798
01:03:17.560 --> 01:03:21.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pag-e-ensayo tungkol sa gender rights bilang human rights.

asr-000799
01:03:21.580 --> 01:03:23.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi naman po kasi yan dapat iwalay.

asr-000800
01:03:23.420 --> 01:03:27.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, bagamat nais po natin sa gender in development,

asr-000801
01:03:27.420 --> 01:03:31.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: bigyan din ng emphasis yung engagement, involvement,

asr-000802
01:03:31.560 --> 01:03:37.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at kung panong partners ang men and boys sa usapin po ng pagkakapantay-pantay.

asr-000803
01:03:37.680 --> 01:03:42.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At lahat po yan, nag-a-apply, hindi lang sa mga kababayan, kalalakihan,

asr-000804
01:03:42.480 --> 01:03:46.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pero sa lahat po ng ating gender diverse people.

asr-000805
01:03:46.460 --> 01:03:50.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon po, bilang panghuling katanungan, dahil alam ko po, nagtapos na ang aking oras.

asr-000806
01:03:50.880 --> 01:03:51.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Thank you.

asr-000807
